{\b\fs24 Kaldor beta - licence and beta agreement}\par
Please read this before installing. By installing Kaldor you agree to it.\par
{\b 1. Beta software}\par
This is a beta version of Kaldor. It is unfinished: it can contain errors, stop working, or behave differently from the final version. Do not rely on it for a paid or important performance without a backup, and keep copies of your music. Download Kaldor only from https://github.com/BramCelis/Kaldor/releases.\par
{\b 2. Your music and data}\par
Kaldor reads your music files and, if you use it, your rekordbox library; it does not change them. It keeps its own settings and music library in your user folders. These stay on your computer when you uninstall Kaldor. Kaldor does not send anything over the internet.\par
{\b 3. Feedback}\par
Feedback, bug reports and ideas you send about the beta may be used to improve Kaldor, without any obligation.\par
